// Loopback jumpers on the expansion header of the lab kits:
// EXP4-EXP7 (PC0-PA4), EXP6-EXP9 (PC1-PA5), EXP8-EXP11 (PC2-PA6), EXP10-EXP13 (PC3-PA7).
// Twister fixtures: gpio_loopback, spi_loopback, pwm_loopback, uart_loopback, gpio_spi_loopback.
gpioPort:
    32 -> gpioPort@4
    4 -> gpioPort@32
    33 -> gpioPort@5
    5 -> gpioPort@33
    34 -> gpioPort@6
    6 -> gpioPort@34
    35 -> gpioPort@7
    7 -> gpioPort@35
